  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d1_recept_zoete_zege.lied.1": "One crumb on its own is so small in the sea,",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d1_recept_zoete_zege.lied.10": "This is our sweet nibble victory!",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d1_recept_zoete_zege.lied.11": "Together nobody... can... beat us, yeaaah!",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d1_recept_zoete_zege.lied.2": "a bubble you blow drifts away on the breeze.",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d1_recept_zoete_zege.lied.3": "But look all around you: the whole town is here,",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d1_recept_zoete_zege.lied.4": "with drums and with ears full of cheer!",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d1_recept_zoete_zege.lied.5": "So switch on the lights... and hold on to your ears...",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d1_recept_zoete_zege.lied.6": "This is our sweet nibble victory!",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d1_recept_zoete_zege.lied.7": "Hear the bottom thumping, hear the bubbles go!",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d1_recept_zoete_zege.lied.8": "All together we are never shy,",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d1_recept_zoete_zege.lied.9": "because together nobody can beat us!",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d1_recept_zoete_zege.lied.intro": "♪ Spongeguh takes a deep breath... ♪",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d2_finale_guhfy_guhber.lied.1": "They said: kiddo, you're nothing but a kid,",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d2_finale_guhfy_guhber.lied.10": "Bikini Bottom, wake up... NYEG!",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d2_finale_guhfy_guhber.lied.11": "I'm a Guhfy Guhber!",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d2_finale_guhfy_guhber.lied.12": "With ice cream on my head and a nibble in my hand!",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d2_finale_guhfy_guhber.lied.13": "I'm a Guhfy Guhber!",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d2_finale_guhfy_guhber.lied.14": "The loudest little guh in all the land!",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d2_finale_guhfy_guhber.lied.2": "with an ice-cream hat on and your ears flapping in the wind.",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d2_finale_guhfy_guhber.lied.3": "But the small ones blow the biggest bubbles of all,",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d2_finale_guhfy_guhber.lied.4": "and whoever laughs with their ears wins the game!",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d2_finale_guhfy_guhber.lied.5": "I'm a Guhfy Guhber!",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d2_finale_guhfy_guhber.lied.6": "With ice cream on my head and a nibble in my hand!",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d2_finale_guhfy_guhber.lied.7": "I'm a Guhfy Guhber!",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d2_finale_guhfy_guhber.lied.8": "The loudest little guh in all the land!",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d2_finale_guhfy_guhber.lied.9": "Buckets off! Buckets off!",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d2_finale_guhfy_guhber.lied.intro": "♪ A guitar tears through the Bubble Bowl! ♪",
  "scene.guhs.einde2_sp_d2_weg_monsters.lied.1": "Deep in the Trench, where the light never goes,",
